らしいお茶菓子なのでしょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/NOhYLPQshEBzFaS5uazMXHDSrdKqXfei.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"(ここの椅子はずいぶんと柔らかそうですね)","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/G0CmUW80ISbFicxEJGqe0E4P8HeFwKKR.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_CommonSkill","category":"battle","text":"お口に合うと良いのですが。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/q5nKImHYBPzmG0rzl6pCKY2IHmz8FUZj.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_ExSkill_1","category":"battle","text":"素敵なティータイムに音楽は欠かせませんね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/riFELTjJwovfWdnajLiBHrTYChgFF3Pv.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_ExSkill_2","category":"battle","text":"礼砲は略式で。ですが、敬意をお忘れなく。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/til0xxAAJjEEBiI4qeKjD9WlNPlj6TFE.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_ExSkill_3","category":"battle","text":"たまにはフレーバーを変えるのも悪くないですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/hq4NwawR4wgy811haxjYELWNJ1PTTo6L.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"砲手、支援を。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/m18NWtlGvTvsbLBqDD5TJfn5hxAQa3Vd.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_ExSkill_Level_2","category":"battle","text":"お客様のお見送りも、丁寧に。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/wtirc0KVAZslr0klhKfCCXaKqcGkowom.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_ExSkill_Level_3","category":"battle","text":"トリニティの砲撃術は優秀ですから。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/L5VLxmJgVLWVjzLws5z6R3dM1R91t9H5.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_ExWeapon_Get","category":"growup","text":"この拳銃は小さいですから、お茶を淹れる際の邪魔にならず愛用しておりました。 ですが、護身にはあまり向いていないのかもしれません。 もしもの時は……よろしくお願い致しますね、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/zKX6sHiqhSWqiVOKVl2L4gpVsNTxag1F.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Gachaget","category":"growup","text":"ごきげんよう。トリニティ総合学園、ティーパーティーの ホストを務めております桐藤ナギサと申します。微力ながら 先生のお役に立てるよう尽力してまいります。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/V2OOrPvZzhBfqZO9KJu8JeeNSk4OcE8W.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Growup_1","category":"growup","text":"先生のお言葉、心に刻んでまいります。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/kKTXTgqCVt7wRHEkPIR5MaQLZz8xIC5X.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Growup_2","category":"growup","text":"ふふっ。この力があれば、ティーパーティーのホストとして不足はないでしょう。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/Hbge8cFvOYt9tAa8nmzHeib5ESg78K0T.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Growup_3","category":"growup","text":"なるほど、そういう方法が…。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/ZoUtX6P3d5AVAoCmKQbY8fvaaDylnpSg.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Growup_4","category":"growup","text":"先生にはいただいてばかりですね。ありがとうございます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/CQL6MpQiLqCEr6Z0KuoFEdrgS3zYrG1p.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"ふふ。今日もいいお天気ですね。 日課が終わりましたら、お散歩でもいかがでしょう？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/3Oj7IsWLEVYCByvyCFiOLmIt2Nznc6RV.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"\tあら？茶器を温めるウォーマーは、一体どこに…… ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/GY6NCL8vosylb59q0ObSDt491NjlJXjG.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"あ……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/4NRT0rfSFSLnyxuw3aeYf1aVmN4ozigB.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Lobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"業務に集中していると、ここがシャーレの執務室であることをつい忘れてしまいます…… 失礼いたしました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/Xy7eDLsoGNRr5d8joqPH3CATfvuxylaw.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"シャーレの執務室はティーパーティーと違って人目が少なく、落ち着きますね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/Ya7ItS8VAXTt7cwRgRJhFB86EIJOz6PL.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"トリニティ生の模範となるためには、日頃から人目を意識をすることが大切です。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/XVSpN2jRMlUxlZjUO4bVsWA0ynC2s8zw.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"(なんだか……安心したからか、眠くなってきました……)","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/RhjGmNLjiVROQdcIi49hVkCOPmGszjhA.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"ティーパーティーの業務はデスクワークが多いですから、椅子選びが重要なのです。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/s5b4aD3LrXGsEPC6YxaQlrH7GedlbE7D.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"よろしければ先生も、シャーレに新しい椅子を買ってみては？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/ATY8aQUgxX73KpBTelZ1u4yBn70eb4NN.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_LogIn_1","category":"lobby","text":"ごきげんよう、先生。 少し遅くなるようでしたので、お茶を淹れてお待ちしておりました。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/7IORpR6nQlQt3a1I04WzGQpQkxXGmO9j.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_LogIn_2","category":"lobby","text":"おかえりなさい、先生。 よろしければ、業務を始める前に紅茶はいかがですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/GIHGHwryXkwQOqmwaXpVUebK2Oluasks.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_MemorialLobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"ふふっ……ほのかに香るベルガモットの風味が、 爽やかで良いですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/5E7OuC9thSYdmrtQTQONliwAZKj0NKGv.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_MemorialLobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"(……これは、やはり昆布…… 誤魔化しようのない香りがしますね……)","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/RD9UhDBVjEFF3AOvDtNB8UzvGDqGmU8H.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_MemorialLobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"このすっきりとした後味が、 お茶菓子にとてもよく合いますね……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/qxxRJN7SvD5Y6IQg4BFblHEGjnJXsM0W.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_MemorialLobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"(昆布の出汁が強すぎて、 口内でお菓子の味と喧嘩を……)","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/tdSijFC6Gg1kRTFp2xIHbL67X2gI4RhY.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_MemorialLobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"……？先生にとっても 初めての味わいでしたか？したか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/rP3spdSffGg3g0s0NfWOf1voxcpwIbf7.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_MemorialLobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"そ、そうでしょうね…… あまり手に入らないタイプの茶葉ですし……ふ、ふふ……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/7OZp0wKxJu9fZcrUKq0Y00N6GZoI96rX.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_MemorialLobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"(……バレてませんよね？ 香りはちょっとアレですが、色はそれっぽいですし……)","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/4SFlGNPL7g86Sm8JAuqfA5szdADVaDwL.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_MemorialLobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"(こうなると分かっていたら、 無理をせずに普通の紅茶を頼んでおけば……)","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/wzNjcA3YG7E3nQx0Hxxe8VbSQrf3sR7h.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Relationship_Up_1","category":"growup","text":"先生とのティータイムは…… なんだか普段より、お茶を楽しむ時間が長くなってしまいます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/sEaqtgViWq1PhmB7Bo5vIhtgDeNQCFze.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Relationship_Up_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"美味しい紅茶が恋しくなりましたら、いつでもティーパーティーにお越しください。お待ちしております。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/ZrCBCkgNPyCumglK7CqhcYfZkmBQyb4q.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Relationship_Up_3","category":"growup","text":"ふふっ。いつもお気遣いいただき、ありがとうございます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/SkwuoiNElvrUXvD8oOhC76LkyiaJ3z6l.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Relationship_Up_4","category":"growup","text":"先生のお心遣いに感謝を。 トリニティの生徒一同を代表し、お礼申し上げます。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/PBB6ijsAWt8Z4x2coU7UpWE47YurVFyD.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Season_Birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日プレゼント……ですか？ ええと、特別なにか欲しい物はありませんが……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/3NURAqIO3PVInoGlP62AprffGzX8W9Aq.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Season_Birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"先生と一日を共に過ごせるのなら、それ以上の贈り物はありません。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/uAfPUDS6G9xjo0tXOSCdPgWzRvKU3pHz.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Season_Birthday_Player_1","category":"lobby","text":"お誕生日おめでとうございます、先生。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/SU0q0BA6CPxLBdNFuDQs5GAJ7OMcyHXM.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Season_Birthday_Player_2","category":"lobby","text":"特別な茶葉をご用意いたしました。 業務を終えられましたら、トリニティのテラスにいらしてください。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/I2YMkP4iBjdnr5JZLxPlYMapBhKUsUsl.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Season_Halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"これはミカさんから頂いたハロウィーン限定パンプキンティーなのですが…… 味が少し、妙です……。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/f2ISShvUa4BLDO8bjzhzHvaUnil7IPpk.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Season_Halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"……え？パンプキンティーではなく…パンプキンスープペースト……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/jB9V6dq8knI1q43H3Q3oGSahVe9gcLPO.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Season_Halloween_3","category":"lobby","text":"ミーカーさーんー！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/TV0djvNon4rgbqcdzuykpIl4acSif5Nc.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Season_NewYear","category":"lobby","text":"あけましておめでとうございます。 今年も変わらぬご指導を、よろしくお願いいたします。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/tpjBIWpGVqQOW5pK8beoVx40Y4EtYbwz.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Season_Xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"……今年ももう少しで終わりますね。 先生、クリスマスケーキは召し上がりましたか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/zNTPVyiz8AeMTHQUXRKjNTgmiD2m0Bls.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Season_Xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"もし、まだでしたら「クリスマスプリン」を用意しましたので、ご一緒にいかがですか？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/ziWTWz3xeyYOUuO6FebTRJTJ4kHaqNVV.ogg"},{"description":"Nagisa_Title","category":"lobby","text":"ブルーアーカイブ","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/VU2UtZ1tsKpwD4S4oG9ffovTyF7wMI6X.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"食後の運動にちょうど良いですね。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/jp/nagisa_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"ふふ、今日は少し遠くまで足を伸ばしてみましょうか。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/jp/nagisa_formation_in_1.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"nagisa_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"呵呵呵，您好。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"咖啡的香气…… 偶尔闻闻也不错呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"（这里是众多学员聚集 的场所，我得多打起一点 精神……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"哎呀， 这茶点真可爱。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"（……这里的椅子， 看上去都相当柔软呢。）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"希望合您的口味。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"美好的下午茶，可少不了音乐。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"礼炮可以简化，但不要忘记敬意。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"偶尔换个口味，也不错。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"炮手，支援。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"送客也不可失了礼数。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"崔尼蒂的炮击技术可是很优秀的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"这把手枪很小巧，不会妨碍我泡茶，我很喜 欢。可是……它也许并不太适合防身。 如果真的到了那个时候…… 就拜托您了，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"呵呵，今天的散步就稍微走远一点吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"当作饭后运动正好呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"您好，我是崔尼蒂综合学院， 茶话会的主持者，桐藤渚。 我会尽绵薄之力帮助老师的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"老师的教诲，我会铭记在心的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，身为茶话会的主持者，我有了这份力量之后，应该不会再有所欠缺。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"原来如此，竟然还有这种方法。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"我总是受老师照顾呢。非常感谢您。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，今天天气也很不错呢。工作结束以后， 要一起去散散步吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"咦？我用来加热茶具的 加热器去哪里了……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"啊……？！啊……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_lobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_2_3","category":"lobby","text":"我工作得太专心， 忘了自己现在是在沙勒的办公室……真是不好意思。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_lobby_2_3.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"沙勒的办公室不像茶话会， 没有旁人的目光，让人很放松呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_lobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"平时，为了给崔尼蒂的学员们做好表率， 我必须随时注意别人的目光。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_lobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"（是因为……放松下来了吗…… 感觉好困啊……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"茶话会有许多需要伏案的工作， 所以一定要挑一把舒适的椅子。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_lobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师也给自己在沙勒 挑一把新椅子怎么样？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_lobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您好。我想您会晚来一会儿， 所以提前泡好了茶。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师，欢迎回来。开始工作之前， 要先来一杯红茶吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_memoriallobby_1_1","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵……这微微散发出的 香柠檬味道，真是清爽可口呀。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_memoriallobby_1_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_memoriallobby_1_2","category":"lobby","text":"（这，果然是海带…… 这股味道是不会骗人的……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_memoriallobby_1_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_memoriallobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"这红茶特有的清爽余味， 和茶点真的很配呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_memoriallobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_memoriallobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"（海带的味道太过强烈…… 就好像在口腔里跟茶点的味道打架一样……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_memoriallobby_2_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯？老师也是第一次 尝到这种味道吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"我，我想也是…… 毕竟这种茶叶不是随随便便就能弄到的…… 呃呵，呵呵呵……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"（……应该没有暴露吧？ 虽然味道有些奇怪，但光看颜色还是有模有样的……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_memoriallobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_memoriallobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"（早知会这样，就不多此一举， 买普通的红茶就好了……）","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_memoriallobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"和老师一起喝茶的时候，总觉得时间过得要慢一些。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"如果您想喝美味的红茶了，随时欢迎您来茶话会，我会恭候您的光临。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，一直以来劳您费心了，老师。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"感谢老师的关心，我代表崔尼蒂的全体学员，向您致谢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_birthday_1","category":"lobby","text":"您是说……生日礼物吗？嗯，没什么特别想要的呢……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_birthday_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_birthday_2","category":"lobby","text":"能和老师一起度过今天， 对我来说，就是最好的礼物了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_birthday_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_birthday_player_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您生日快乐。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_birthday_player_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_birthday_player_2","category":"lobby","text":"我为您准备了特别的茶叶。等您工作结束后， 请来一趟崔尼蒂的露台。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_birthday_player_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师， 听说今天正是山海经的传统节日。 为此我特意准备了绿茶， 就让我们来品品吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_halloween_1","category":"lobby","text":"这是未花小姐送我的 万圣节限定南瓜茶……可是味道有些奇怪……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_halloween_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_halloween_2","category":"lobby","text":"……嗯？ 这不是南瓜茶…… 而是南瓜糊……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_halloween_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_halloween_3","category":"lobby","text":"未——花——小——姐——！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_halloween_3.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"听说最近很流行用月饼来搭配红茶？ 可惜我还没有试过…… 诶？您要送我月饼吗？ 谢，谢谢您，我很期待。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"祝您新年快乐。今年也请您一如既往地指导我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_xmas_1","category":"lobby","text":"……今年也要结束了呢。老师，您吃过圣诞蛋糕了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_xmas_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_season_xmas_2","category":"lobby","text":"如果还没吃的话， 我准备了圣诞布丁， 要和我一起尝尝吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_season_xmas_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/cn/nagisa_title.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"nagisa_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/nagisa_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/nagisa_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/nagisa_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/nagisa_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/nagisa_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/nagisa_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/nagisa_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/nagisa_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_2_1","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E6%A1%90%E8%97%A4%20%E6%B8%9A/original/nagisa_lobby_2_1.ogg"},{"description":"nagisa_lobby_2_2","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"","